vcdec (libvcdec), linked into FFmpeg's h264_vchiq decoder, Reel and
ReelEGL, is from ReelHWAccel: https://github.com/adyoull/riscos-reelhwaccel

ReelHWAccel is a new implementation. It drives the Raspberry Pi's
VideoCore through the VCHIQ module in RISC OS's ROM, with its own MMAL
client, based on the MMAL message formats as Linux's VCHIQ MMAL driver
(vchiq-mmal, GPL-2.0) defines them in its headers (there's no published
specification of the protocol).

ReelHWAccel contains none of the driver's code, but because it used the
driver as its reference it is treated as derived from it, so it has the
same licence as the driver: the GNU General Public License version 2. The licence's text is GPLv2 in this directory;
the source is at the address above.
